  "instructions": [
    {
      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350\u00b0F oven. Lay walnuts on a baking sheet and roast for 5 to 7 minutes. Chop coarsely and set aside."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Pot: Cook 2 cups of rice (to make 4 cups cooked). Add a dash of salt and tsp of oil to the cooking water."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Bowl: Combine the olive oil, orange zest, orange juice, vinegar, sea salt, pepper, and nutmeg. Mix well. The add rice, cranberries, apple, celery, celery leaves, parsley and chopped walnuts."
    },
    {
      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Toss all together until the salad is well-mixed. You can eat this warm of cold."
